
# 2026-09-21 18:48:29.059337
+Fix the bug in Add so it returns the sum of a and b instead of the difference.

# 2026-09-25 17:19:46.220149
+In XRWheelInput.cs make these changes and nothing else:
+1. Change the default of wheelSpinAxis from Vector3.forward to Vector3.right (the grabbable KartSteer wheel rotates around its local X axis).
+2. Change the default of maxWheelAngle from 450f to 90f (the ToAngleAxis-based measurement cannot exceed 180 degrees, so 450 made full lock unreachable).
+3. Remove the triggerThreshold field. Add two serialized fields right after maxWheelAngle: '[SerializeField] private OVRInput.Button accelerateButton = OVRInput.Button.One;' and '[SerializeField] private OVRInput.Button brakeButton = OVRInput.Button.Two;'.
+4. In GenerateInput, replace the accelerate line and the whole trigger-based brake block (leftTrigger, rightTrigger, brake) with exactly:
+            bool accelerate = OVRInput.Get(accelerateButton, OVRInput.Controller.Touch);
+            bool brake = OVRInput.Get(brakeButton, OVRInput.Controller.Touch);
+Triggers are no longer used because they are needed for grabbing the wheel. Brake also reverses when stopped (handled by ArcadeKart).

